#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:271
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ThankYouForTheParts"
msgid ""
"Yes? If you're looking for STERN,\n"
"that would be me.\p"
"Ah! Those must be the parts I ordered\n"
"from MR. STONE of DEVON.\p"
"Thank you! That's great!\n"
"We can prepare for our expedition now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:279
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WellTakeThoseParts"
msgid ""
"Hehehe, hold it!\n"
"We'll take those parts!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:283
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SternWhoAreYou"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN: Wh-what?\n"
"Who are you people?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:287
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WereTeamAqua"
msgid ""
"We're TEAM AQUA!\p"
"Our BOSS wants those parts!\n"
"Shut your yap and fork them over!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:292
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid ""
"Awaaaah!\n"
"A kid beat me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_BossGoingToBeFurious"
msgid ""
"Oh, man, what a disaster…\n"
"The BOSS is going to be furious…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_LetMeTakeCareOfThis"
msgid ""
"Humph, sniveling wimp!\n"
"Let me take care of this!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid ""
"What?!\n"
"I lost, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:308
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_MeddlingKid"
msgid ""
"Now what? If we don't get the parts,\n"
"we're in for it!\p"
"Arrgh, I didn't count on being meddled\n"
"with by some meddling kid!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_CameToSeeWhatsTakingSoLong"
msgid ""
"I came to see what was taking so\n"
"long to snatch some parts, and you\l"
"simps are held up by a mere child?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:319
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ArchieWarning"
msgid ""
"We are TEAM AQUA,\n"
"and we love the sea!\p"
"And I am TEAM AQUA's leader,\n"
"ARCHIE!\p"
"What makes you interfere with us?\p"
"…No! You can't be!\n"
"You're not one of TEAM MAGMA?\p"
"Wait, that can't be right.\n"
"You're not dressed for the part.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"POKéMON, people… All life depends on\n"
"the sea.\p"
"So, TEAM AQUA is dedicated to\n"
"the expansion of the sea.\p"
"Don't you agree? What we are doing\n"
"is a magnificent undertaking.\p"
"Ah, fine…\n"
"You're still too young to understand\l"
"our noble objective.\p"
"But, I warn you, don't even consider\n"
"interfering with our plans again.\p"
"The consequences will cost you\n"
"dearly!\p"
"And don't you forget it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SternThankYouForSavingUs"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN: You're…\n"
"Ah, okay, you're {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"Anyway, that was a tense situation!\n"
"Thank you for saving us!\p"
"Oh, yes, I almost forgot that you\n"
"even brought the parts from DEVON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SternIveGotToGo"
msgid ""
"CAPT. STERN: Whoops!\n"
"There's no time to lose!\p"
"We have to set out on our ocean-floor\n"
"expedition really soon.\p"
"Thanks again, but now I've got\n"
"to go!\p"
"Feel free to wander around and check\n"
"out our facilities, though.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_RemindsMeOfAbandonedShip"
msgid ""
"I saw a model of a ship here.\p"
"It reminded me of the ABANDONED SHIP\n"
"near DEWFORD TOWN…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:369
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_DontRunInMuseum"
msgid ""
"Don't you dare run around inside\n"
"the MUSEUM!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:373
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WantToRideSubmarine"
msgid ""
"Wow, the submarine's awesome!\n"
"I want to go for a ride!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:377
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WaterQualitySample1"
msgid ""
"“WATER QUALITY SAMPLE 1,” the\n"
"label says.\p"
"The sea is all connected, but the\n"
"water seems to differ by region.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:383
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WaterQualitySample2"
msgid ""
"“WATER QUALITY SAMPLE 2,” the\n"
"label says.\p"
"Does the saltiness of seawater differ\n"
"by region, too?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:389
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_PressureExperiment"
msgid ""
"A rubber ball is expanding and\n"
"shrinking.\p"
"“In the sea, the weight of water itself\n"
"exerts pressure.\p"
"“In shallow water, the pressure is not\n"
"very heavy.\p"
"“However, in extremely deep water,\n"
"the pressure can reach even tens of\l"
"thousands of tons on a small area.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:400
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_HoennModel"
msgid ""
"“MODEL OF HOENN REGION”\p"
"It's a miniature diorama of the\n"
"HOENN region.\p"
"Where is LITTLEROOT TOWN on this?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:406
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_DeepSeawaterDisplay"
msgid ""
"It's a display on the flow of seawater.\p"
"“Near the bottom of the sea, water\n"
"flows due to differences in such\l"
"factors as temperature and salinity.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:412
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SurfaceSeawaterDisplay"
msgid ""
"It's a display on the flow of seawater.\p"
"“Toward the surface, seawater flows\n"
"as currents driven by the winds.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SSTidalReplica"
msgid ""
"“THE FERRY S.S. TIDAL\p"
"“A scale replica of the ship under\n"
"construction at STERN'S SHIPYARD.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:422
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SubmarineReplica"
msgid ""
"“SUBMARINE EXPLORER 1\p"
"“A replica of the high-performance\n"
"ocean floor exploration submarine.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:427
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SumbersibleReplica"
msgid ""
"“SUBMERSIBLE POD\p"
"“A replica of a compact, unmanned\n"
"pod for seafloor exploration.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc:432
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SSAnneReplica"
msgid ""
"“S.S. ANNE\p"
"“A replica of the luxury liner that\n"
"circles the globe.”$"
msgstr ""
